shot4.png", "id": "137680308470668", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_137680311804001_2482552843683822870_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1f_S_cIGjsIQ7kNvwHTW1wT&_nc_oc=Adric8e23ZD1HRqyCrwS00RhUYZTUxfbI2Aqf7VLgMCQ7H8d9zdsX3cjZlT6pN3xfKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7U8XJMrunYI7iPBII88_-1WV-s6tLqWJLzHYJAocHacA&oe=6A1EDB53"}, {"file_name": "bike-assets_screenshot5.png", "id": "2997003700575618", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031533_2997003703908951_990586037920946501_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rpd8YITlapAQ7kNvwGlOZ3d&_nc_oc=Adq_OxWBcOmL_w6n2zJBioBG-i0ljnNMKf7l4upo9aTWjw0iT97AoP0LRe2HCjkii3w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af69x2Eixe9oEkuVKffXnAFQsg0uQYAtKFZ0kVNbhvt8zQ&oe=6A1EE26B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MotoX", "keywords": [], "long_description": "(MotoX is currently under development and testing for oculus quest and quest 2.)\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\n- Explore unique and interesting Environments\n- High-speed racing against opponents\n- Clear Death-defying stunts\n- Dodge Obstacles\n- Unique music themed for each location\n- Collect coins to unlock new Bikes\n- Progress through new and exciting worlds\n- Comfort controls\n\nCOMING SOON:\n\n- New worlds and levels\n- Character customization\n- Leaderboards\n- Target shooting\n", "short_description": "MotoX is an immersive motocross/motorcycle racing game where players can experience the speed, danger, and adrenaline of a virtual Motocross experience. Ride through 7 unique worlds that you can explore on your own or compete against other racers."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.enverstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Enver Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.enverstudio.com/", "c